WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.323
Want your app on Google Play?

2
00:00:02.323 --> 00:00:04.460
New personal accounts have a rule.

3
00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:07.729
You need twelve testers, for fourteen days in a row.

4
00:00:07.729 --> 00:00:09.300
Here is how to find them.

5
00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:14.654
Google asks for twelve people to opt in to a closed test.

6
00:00:14.654 --> 00:00:18.014
They must stay opted in for fourteen days in a row.

7
00:00:18.014 --> 00:00:21.702
If the count drops below twelve, the clock starts again.

8
00:00:21.702 --> 00:00:23.810
Company accounts skip this rule.

9
00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:28.750
So do personal accounts made before November thirteen, twenty twenty three.

10
00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:30.986
Step one.

11
00:00:30.986 --> 00:00:32.398
Join Shipvo Testers.

12
00:00:32.398 --> 00:00:36.141
It is a group of founders who test each other's apps.

13
00:00:36.141 --> 00:00:37.271
Anyone can join.

14
00:00:37.271 --> 00:00:40.025
Members cannot see each other's emails.

15
00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:42.949
Step two.

16
00:00:42.949 --> 00:00:45.745
In Play Console, make a closed test track.

17
00:00:45.745 --> 00:00:47.876
Upload your first build by hand.

18
00:00:47.876 --> 00:00:51.071
Play does not allow that step through the A P I.

19
00:00:51.071 --> 00:00:54.200
Then add the Shipvo Testers group to the track.

20
00:00:56.350 --> 00:00:57.663
Or let Shipvo do it.

21
00:00:57.663 --> 00:00:59.303
Run shipvo store testers.

22
00:00:59.303 --> 00:01:01.469
It prints the steps for your app.

23
00:01:01.469 --> 00:01:04.684
Add your Play key, and it adds the group for you.

24
00:01:04.684 --> 00:01:06.325
It never removes a group.

25
00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:09.032
Step three.

26
00:01:09.032 --> 00:01:11.759
Share your opt-in link with your own people.

27
00:01:11.759 --> 00:01:14.425
They open it, opt in, and install your app.

28
00:01:18.350 --> 00:01:19.032
Step four.

29
00:01:19.032 --> 00:01:20.124
Test other apps.

30
00:01:20.124 --> 00:01:23.059
The community works because everyone tests.

31
00:01:23.059 --> 00:01:25.925
Keep them installed for the fourteen days.

32
00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:31.555
We cannot promise how many people will opt in.

33
00:01:31.555 --> 00:01:33.227
But now you have a plan.

34
00:01:33.227 --> 00:01:35.875
Join at shipvo.dev/testers.
